    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 24 January 2013 the head of the HQDCB transferred D.’s complaint to the Qualification and Disciplinary Commission of the Regional Bar of Zakarpattya (“the QDC of Zakarpattya”). He noted that, in accordance with Article 33 § 3 of the Law on the Bar and practice of law, a complaint lodged against an advocate elected to a self-government body had to be examined by a regional Bar located outside of the region in which the advocate had been elected."^^xsd:string .

